Identifies general information in short written and spoken conversations."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Identifies general information in short written and spoken conversations."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Identifies general information in short written and spoken conversations."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Identifies general information in short written and spoken conversations."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Identifies general information in short written and spoken conversations."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Identifies general information in short written and spoken conversations."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Identifies general information in short written and spoken conversations."}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Present Continuous vs. Be Going To"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use the <span class=\"strong\">Present Continuous</span> and <span class=\"strong\">be going to</span> to talk about future actions and events.<br><br> You use the <span class=\"strong\">Present Continuous</span> to talk about arrangements and plans. <span class=\"strong\">Be going to</span> puts an emphasis on the idea of intention (decide to do something).<br>Example: <span class=\"italic\">I'm going scuba diving. vs. I'm going to go scuba diving.</span> <br><br>You can use <span class=\"strong\">intend to</span> in place of <span class=\"strong\">be going to</span>.<br> Example:<span class=\"italic\"> I intend to go scuba diving tomorrow. </span> "}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Extreme Sports"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "In North America, extreme sports are very popular. <br><br>Extreme sports include activities like: <br>rock climbing <Br>surfing <br>windsurfing <br>snowboarding <br>skateboarding <br>mountain biking <br>skydiving <br>hang gliding"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "rock climbing"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the sport of climbing up large rocks and cliffs"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Why don't you try rock climbing?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le03ob10aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " These are words you use to talk about sports."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "windsurfing"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the sport of riding a board that is pushed by the wind"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I'm going to go windsurfing."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le03ob10aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "water polo"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a sport in the water; you throw a ball into a net"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Why don't you try water polo?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le03ob10aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to stay in shape"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to keep healthy and fit"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Playing soccer is a great way to stay in shape."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le03ob10aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "license "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "an official permit to do something"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I have my scuba diving license."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le03ob10aud05"}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn4le03ob10re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Choose an extreme sport."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Go online and research it."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write down 8-10 sentences about the sport."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Tell your partner about it."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Listen to your partner's report."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Which sport do you want to try?"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I identify extreme sports."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I write complete statements describing a sport."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I discuss about extreme sports with my partner and choose one to try."}]}], "type": "sena"}